1
00:00:00,791 --> 00:00:02,089
As Uke strikes

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:04,692
step in deeply to his rear
controlling his wrist,

3
00:00:04,993 --> 00:00:06,005
cut down

4
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:08,478
pivoting all the way around towards his rear,

5
00:00:08,479 --> 00:00:09,677
raise his arm up,

6
00:00:09,678 --> 00:00:11,898
place it against your shoulder
controlling his wrist,

7
00:00:12,899 --> 00:00:16,378
lean into it cutting down
so Uke comes down in front of you,

8
00:00:16,979 --> 00:00:19,753
as you do so control his elbow,

9
00:00:19,754 --> 00:00:21,605
turn him over into the pin.

10
00:00:22,206 --> 00:00:29,491
Sit down placing his wrist against your elbow
holding it close against your body.

